('How a rental program works','<p>A rental service supplies garments, collects them, launders them and replaces worn pieces for a recurring fee. You usually sign a contract for a set term. Ask for the full price list and the exit terms in writing before you agree.</p>'),
('How buying your own works','<p>You pay once for garments made with your logo, colours and phone number, and the crew owns them. You wash them yourself and reorder when you hire or when pieces wear out. See <a href="/guides/how-to-uniform-a-trade-crew">how to uniform a trade crew</a>.</p>'),
